{"resourceIdentifier":"833","resourceName":"Winchester Landfill Gas Project","description":"The Winchester Landfill Gas (LFG) Project is located at the Frederick County Regional Landfill in Winchester, Virginia, approximately 80 miles west of Washington, D.C. The project is owned by Frederick County department of Public Works (County). The sanitary landfill opened in 1977. It currently accepts municipal solid waste (MSW) and construction/demolition debris (CDD). In 2008 the site had approximately 3 million metric tons of waste in place and was accepting 120,000 metric tons of waste each year. The landfill consists of three non-contiguous disposal areas: MSW Landfill Permit No. 40, 57 acres with 1.4 million Mg of waste in place, closed","location":{"latitude":39.144266,"longitude":-78.099395},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"833"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VA"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"County of Frederick Public Works Department"},{"type":"string","value":"IN, United States"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"833"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"35318"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV SÜD America Inc."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"06/04/2020"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2nd, 30/09/2018 - 29/09/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Doc